{"seq":2,"slug":"feedback-loop","title":"曝光-点击反馈闭环与马太效应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-recommendation-engineering/coldstart-serving/feedback-loop","wordCount":3722,"readingTime":15,"html":"<h1 id=\"曝光-点击反馈闭环与马太效应\">曝光-点击反馈闭环与马太效应</h1><p>推荐系统有一个其他机器学习系统通常不具备的性质：<strong>它的训练数据由它自己的输出产生</strong>。搜索系统可以从独立的相关性标注中学习，风控系统可以从人工审核中获得标签，而推荐系统的标签只来自「它自己决定展示什么，然后用户如何反应」。这个闭环结构带来了三个逐层加深的问题：数据的选择偏差、位置偏差、以及正反馈放大。本文把这三个问题连成一条因果链，并给出各自的工程处理方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-闭环的因果结构\">核心概念：闭环的因果结构</h2><p>设系统在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 使用模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定展示集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，用户对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 产生反馈 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，系统在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(E_t, Y_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 训练出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这是一个<strong>闭环控制系统</strong>，而不是单向的「数据 → 模型」流水线。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    T1[模型 θt] --&gt; D[决策: 展示集合 Et]&#10;    D --&gt; U[用户反馈 Yt]&#10;    U --&gt; L[训练数据 Dt = Et × Yt]&#10;    L --&gt; T2[模型 θt+1]&#10;    T2 --&gt; D2[决策: 展示集合 Et+1]&#10;    D2 -.-&gt;|反馈回路| U&#10;    L -.-&gt; B1[问题1: 选择偏差&lt;br/&gt;只有被展示的才有标签]&#10;    L -.-&gt; B2[问题2: 位置偏差&lt;br/&gt;位置影响点击]&#10;    L -.-&gt; B3[问题3: 正反馈放大&lt;br/&gt;高分→曝光→数据→更高分]\">graph TD\n    T1[模型 θt] --&gt; D[决策: 展示集合 Et]\n    D --&gt; U[用户反馈 Yt]\n    U --&gt; L[训练数据 Dt = Et × Yt]\n    L --&gt; T2[模型 θt+1]\n    T2 --&gt; D2[决策: 展示集合 Et+1]\n    D2 -.-&gt;|反馈回路| U\n    L -.-&gt; B1[问题1: 选择偏差&lt;br/&gt;只有被展示的才有标签]\n    L -.-&gt; B2[问题2: 位置偏差&lt;br/&gt;位置影响点击]\n    L -.-&gt; B3[问题3: 正反馈放大&lt;br/&gt;高分→曝光→数据→更高分]</pre><p>三个问题的递进关系是：选择偏差让模型无法评估从未展示的商品（<strong>无标签区</strong>）；位置偏差让模型在有标签区也学到错误的东西（<strong>有标签但标签脏</strong>）；正反馈放大让前两个问题随时间自我强化，最终导致系统收敛到用户已知兴趣的小圈子里（<strong>系统性退化</strong>）。因此三者不是并列的三个坑，而是同一条因果链上的三段——只处理其中一个通常无效，因为退化由三者共同驱动。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>影响对象</th>\n<th>主要处理手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>选择偏差</td>\n<td>长尾商品无曝光无标签</td>\n<td>召回与排序的评估</td>\n<td>探索、反事实评估、随机化数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位置偏差</td>\n<td>位置高的点击率高（与质量无关）</td>\n<td>排序模型的训练标签</td>\n<td>倾向得分 / IPS 加权、位置特征剥离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正反馈放大</td>\n<td>头部越来越强，长尾永无机会</td>\n<td>系统长期的覆盖与发现性</td>\n<td>探索预算、扶持配额、多样性约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反馈延迟</td>\n<td>转化标签滞后数天至数周</td>\n<td>训练数据新鲜度</td>\n<td>延迟标签处理、增量训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幸存者偏差</td>\n<td>只见到被展示过的商品的转化</td>\n<td>转化率估计</td>\n<td>全候选反事实估计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"位置偏差的校正-ips-与位置作为特征\">位置偏差的校正：IPS 与位置作为特征</h2><p>第一章第一篇给出了位置偏差的分解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>click</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>examined</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>relevant</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{click} \\mid u,i,p) = P(\\text{examined} \\mid p) \\cdot P(\\text{relevant} \\mid u,i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">click</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">examined</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">relevant</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，这里给出两种把它落实为训练方法的实现。</p>\n<p><strong>方法一：逆倾向得分加权（IPS）。</strong> 给每个样本按其被观察的概率的倒数加权：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>IPS</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{IPS}} = \\sum_{(u,i,p) \\in \\mathcal{D}} \\frac{1}{q(p)} \\cdot \\ell\\big(y_{uip}, \\hat{y}_{ui}\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">IPS</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8374em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>examined</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q(p) = P(\\text{examined} \\mid p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">examined</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的倾向得分（被看到的概率），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span> 是逐样本损失。直觉是：被展示在低位置（低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>）却仍被点击的样本是稀有且有信息的，因此给它更大的权重；被展示在第一位（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q \\approx 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）的点击是廉价的，权重接近 1。这样训练出来的模型与「如果所有商品都被展示在随机位置」的分布一致，从而位置不再是混淆变量（无偏 LTR 的 IPS 框架见 Joachims 等, <em>Unbiased Learning-to-Rank with Biased Feedback</em>, WSDM 2017, <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1145/3018661.3018699）。\">https://doi.org/10.1145/3018661.3018699）。</a></p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的估计方式有几种。最简做法是固定一组按经验设定的倾向值（位置 1 为 1.0，位置 2 为 0.8，……递减）；更严谨的做法是从历史日志中<strong>估计位置效应</strong>（用同一商品在不同位置的展示数据拟合），或者通过<strong>线上位置随机化实验</strong>直接测量每个位置的观察率——这是最可靠但成本最高的方式，通常只在关键系统上做一次性测准（不依赖随机化实验的倾向估计方法见 Agarwal 等, <em>Estimating Position Bias without Intrusive Interventions</em>, WSDM 2019, <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1145/3289600.3291017）。\">https://doi.org/10.1145/3289600.3291017）。</a></p>\n<p>IPS 的已知问题是<strong>方差大</strong>：倾向值极低的样本（深翻位置的点击）权重极大，少数样本能主导梯度。缓解手段包括权重截断（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 不超过某个上限）与自归一化 IPS（用权重和归一化）。这两个手段会引入偏差，因此是偏差-方差权衡下的工程选择，而不是免费的改进。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：位置作为特征、推理置零。</strong> 把位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 作为模型的输入特征之一，训练时用真实位置，推理时统一传入基准值。这个方法简单、零额外计算，在位置效应与商品内容弱相关时效果良好。它的失效条件是位置与内容耦合——如果第一位永远放爆款，模型会学到「位置 1 + 这个模式 = 点击」，把内容信号和位置信号缠在一起，推理置零时两者一起消失。检测这个耦合的方式是看位置特征在模型中的重要性或其嵌入范数：若异常高，说明它承载了内容信息。</p>\n<p>两种方法在实践中通常<strong>组合使用</strong>：位置作为特征捕获主要的、与内容无关的位置效应，IPS 加权处理残余的混淆。生产系统还应保留一部分<strong>随机化流量</strong>（小比例请求故意打乱位置）用于持续监控位置效应是否漂移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"正反馈放大与马太效应\">正反馈放大与马太效应</h2><p>位置偏差处理的是「单次决策」的偏差，正反馈放大处理的是「多次决策的累积」。它的机制可以写成三步循环：</p>\n<p>第一步，模型给某商品高分（可能因为它在训练数据里点击率高）。第二步，高分导致它被展示在更好位置，获得更多曝光。第三步，更多曝光产生更多点击数据，使它在下一轮训练中分数更高。</p>\n<p>这个循环本身就是在最大化短期指标的<strong>正解</strong>——问题在于它不收敛到均衡，而是走向极端：少数商品垄断绝大部分曝光，其余商品因缺少数据而被模型低估，形成「富者愈富」的分配。这与经济学里的马太效应同构，在推荐系统里有一个更精确的名字：<strong>曝光-收益循环导致的覆盖度坍缩</strong>。</p>\n<p>循环的两个加速度来源值得单独指出。</p>\n<p><strong>来源一：训练数据的绝对量差异。</strong> 头部商品有百万级曝光样本，长尾有几十个。即使两者的真实质量相同，头部商品的分数估计方差远小于长尾，模型的置信度（表现为分数高低与稳定性）自然偏向头部。这不是模型有偏，而是<strong>小样本估计的固有属性</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>来源二：用户行为的从众效应。</strong> 用户看到某个商品被频繁展示（在多个位置、多个模块出现），会倾向于认为它是好的（社会证明效应）。这使得头部商品的点击率有额外的抬升，进一步强化循环。</p>\n<p>对抗手段有三类，各自作用在不同环节。</p>\n<p><strong>手段一：在召回与排序中保留探索预算。</strong> 每次请求留出固定比例的位置给非头部候选（随机或按不确定性采样）。这就是经典的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>-greedy 或 Thompson 采样思想在工程上的落地：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 比例的流量走探索策略，其余走利用策略（Thompson 采样在展示广告上的大规模经验评估见 Chapelle &amp; Li, <em>An Empirical Evaluation of Thompson Sampling</em>, NIPS 2011, <a href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper/2011/hash/e53a0a2978c28872a4505bdb51db06dc-Abstract.html）。$\\epsilon$\">https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper/2011/hash/e53a0a2978c28872a4505bdb51db06dc-Abstract.html）。$\\epsilon$</a> 的取值需要在「探索收益」与「探索的机会成本」之间权衡，通常取 1%-5%。关键要求是<strong>探索流量必须与利用流量一样埋点完整</strong>，否则探索产生的数据无法用于训练。</p>\n<p><strong>手段二：样本层面的重加权。</strong> 训练时对长尾商品的样本给更高权重，等价于人为放大长尾的有效样本量。权重可按商品的历史曝光量的倒数（取对数后）给出：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∝</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>imp</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i \\propto 1/\\log(1 + \\text{imp}_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">imp</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（用重加权抑制热门偏置的做法见 Abdollahpouri 等, <em>Controlling Popularity Bias in Learning-to-Rank Recommendation</em>, RecSys 2017, <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1145/3109859.3109912）。这与第二章第一篇里对活跃用户降权的做法同源——都是抑制「信息量低的密集样本」。\">https://doi.org/10.1145/3109859.3109912）。这与第二章第一篇里对活跃用户降权的做法同源——都是抑制「信息量低的密集样本」。</a></p>\n<p><strong>手段三：列表层面的覆盖约束（多样性）。</strong> 第三章第二篇的打散机制是最直接的手段：限制同品牌/同类目在列表中的占比，从结构上给长尾商品留出位置。这是三类手段中唯一<strong>不依赖模型训练</strong>的，因此最可靠，但也最粗糙（它保证的是位置分配，不保证被点击）。</p>\n<p>三类手段的配合关系是：覆盖约束保证长尾<strong>有机会出现</strong>，重加权保证长尾<strong>有正确的分数</strong>，探索预算保证长尾<strong>有新数据</strong>。三者缺一则循环会从缺口重新启动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反馈延迟与训练数据的时效性\">反馈延迟与训练数据的时效性</h2><p>闭环还有一个容易被低估的时间维度：不同行为的反馈延迟差异巨大。点击在几百毫秒内即可归因，加购在分钟级，而转化（下单付款）可能延迟数小时到数天（跨境场景还有退货窗口，真正的「确定正例」可能要等数周）。</p>\n<p>延迟带来的直接后果是<strong>训练数据的新鲜度不均衡</strong>：如果等所有转化延迟完成再训练，模型会滞后数天；如果不等，近期的转化样本严重缺失，模型会低估转化率（表现为近期流量上的 CVR 预测系统性偏低，进而导致排序偏向点击率）。这两种错误都真实存在，工程上的处理是分层的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反馈类型</th>\n<th>典型延迟</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>曝光 / 点击</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>直接进入实时训练流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加购 / 收藏</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>实时流 + 短窗口回补</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下单</td>\n<td>小时级</td>\n<td>延迟等待窗口 + 后续回补（backfill）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>付款成功</td>\n<td>小时至天级</td>\n<td>归因窗口 + 延迟校正（模型估计延迟分布）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退货 / 取消</td>\n<td>数天至数周</td>\n<td>滞后回滚（把正例改回负例并重训）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>延迟校正（把尚未回传的转化按延迟分布估计回来）是展示广告领域的经典问题，其建模方式见 Chapelle, <em>Modeling Delayed Feedback in Display Advertising</em>, KDD 2014, <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1145/2623330.2623634。\">https://doi.org/10.1145/2623330.2623634。</a></p>\n<p>「滞后回滚」是最容易被遗漏的一项：用户下单后取消或退货，这个样本的标签应当从正例改为负例（或附加负向权重）。若不做回滚，模型会系统性地把「易退货商品」学成高转化商品。回滚需要的是<strong>可追溯的样本标识</strong>——训练样本必须记录其业务事件 ID，才能在退货事件到达时定位并修正。这条要求在设计日志 schema 时就必须落实，事后补不上。</p>\n<p>训练时效性的另一个可操作做法是<strong>双模型并行</strong>：一个「短窗口模型」用最近数小时的数据快速跟上分布变化（但标签不完整），一个「长窗口模型」用完整标签但滞后。线上两个分数加权融合，权重按场景调节（大促期间短窗口权重更高）。这个做法与第三章第一篇的模型分层思想一致——用结构而非单一模型解决时效与精度的矛盾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性-如何知道闭环正在退化\">可观测性：如何知道闭环正在退化</h2><p>闭环退化是一个缓慢的过程，等业务方投诉「推荐总是那几件」时，系统已经退化了数月。因此必须建立主动的监控指标体系。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>监控指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>退化信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>曝光集中度</td>\n<td>头部 1% 商品的曝光占比</td>\n<td>持续上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有效覆盖商品数</td>\n<td>单位周期内获得有效曝光（≥阈值）的商品数</td>\n<td>持续下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分数-质量偏离</td>\n<td>模型预测点击率与后续实际点击率的偏差</td>\n<td>系统性偏移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位置效应残留</td>\n<td>位置特征在模型中的重要性</td>\n<td>上升（说明内容与位置耦合）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新商品破零率</td>\n<td>新品获得首次成交的周期</td>\n<td>拉长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>探索流量占比</td>\n<td>实际走探索策略的请求比例</td>\n<td>被配置侵蚀下降</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是最容易被侵蚀但最必须监控的：探索流量配额是「软性」的，它不产生直接收益，因此在系统压力下（延迟紧张、效果下滑）最容易被工程师临时关闭而不恢复。探索配额应当有<strong>配置告警</strong>：低于阈值时报警，而不是静默生效。</p>\n<p>评分体系与质量问题之间的这种反馈关系，与类别中讨论搜索侧干预的 hub 有共同结构——搜索侧的人工干预同样会因为缺少针对长期指标的监控而逐步失控（<code>../17_search-merchandising-personalization/</code>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>推荐系统的训练数据由自身输出产生，构成闭环控制系统；选择偏差、位置偏差、正反馈放大是同一条因果链的三段。</li>\n<li>位置偏差的两种校正：IPS 加权（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/q(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 权重）与位置作特征 + 推理置零；两者常组合使用，并保留随机化流量持续校准。</li>\n<li>正反馈放大的两个加速度来源是训练样本量的绝对差异与用户从众效应；对抗需要三类手段同时到位——覆盖约束（有机会）、样本重加权（分数正确）、探索预算（新数据）。</li>\n<li>反馈延迟要求分层处理，其中「滞后回滚」（退货/取消把正例改回）最易遗漏，且必须在日志 schema 设计时就留出可追溯的事件标识。</li>\n<li>短窗口 + 长窗口双模型并行是解决时效与精度矛盾的常用结构。</li>\n<li>闭环退化必须靠主动监控（曝光集中度、有效覆盖商品数、位置效应残留、探索配额占比）发现，其中探索配额的侵蚀最需要配置级告警。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关内容：位置偏差的输入侧来源见 <a href=\"../rec-vs-search/implicit-vs-explicit\">无查询场景与隐式反馈</a>；覆盖约束的具体算法见 <a href=\"../ranking-diversity/diversity-mmr\">多样性/去重与 MMR 重排</a>；新品扶持配额与扶持期数据校正见 <a href=\"user-item-coldstart\">用户冷启动与新品扶持</a> 与 <a href=\"../multi-recall/rule-hot-new-recall\">热门/新品/运营规则召回兜底</a>；分数校准与训练-服务偏差见 <a href=\"../ranking-diversity/coarse-fine-rank\">推荐粗排与精排模型</a>；延迟预算如何影响日志与埋点见 <a href=\"rec-latency-serving\">推荐链路延迟与降级兜底</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"曝光-点击反馈闭环与马太效应","id":"曝光-点击反馈闭环与马太效应"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：闭环的因果结构","id":"核心概念-闭环的因果结构"},{"level":2,"text":"位置偏差的校正：IPS 与位置作为特征","id":"位置偏差的校正-ips-与位置作为特征"},{"level":2,"text":"正反馈放大与马太效应","id":"正反馈放大与马太效应"},{"level":2,"text":"反馈延迟与训练数据的时效性","id":"反馈延迟与训练数据的时效性"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性：如何知道闭环正在退化","id":"可观测性-如何知道闭环正在退化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"用户冷启动与新品扶持","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-recommendation-engineering/coldstart-serving/user-item-coldstart"},"next":{"title":"推荐链路延迟与降级兜底","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-recommendation-engineering/coldstart-serving/rec-latency-serving"}}